    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700202/6007002020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007002020030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──いや、こっちこそごめんね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700202/6007002020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007002020040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やっぱ５人揃うと違うなぁって思ったからさ、\r\n集まりたくなっちゃって",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700202/6007002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007002020050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ひとりの時も、みんなのこと想像しながら\r\n練習してたつもりだったけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700202/6007002020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007002020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やっぱり本物は違うんだよね\r\n足し算じゃなくてかけ算なの",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700202/6007002020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……アンティーカは、楽しいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007002020070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えー、何それ？　愚問でしょＰたん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700202/6007002020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007002020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰がつまんないところでじっとしてると思う？\r\nそれくらいわかってもらわないと！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700202/6007002020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだよな。……よし、スケジュール、\r\n調整できるところがないか見てみるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007002020090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "さっすがプロデューサー！\r\n話がわかるし仕事がデキる～！",
